                <invention-title lang="de">PALETTENSYSTEM MIT EINER MESSKOMPONENTE</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">SYSTÈME DE PALETTE COMPRENANT UN COMPOSANT DE MESURE</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">PALLET SYSTEM COMPRISING A MEASURING COMPONENT</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>There is disclosed a measuring component (14) for a pallet system comprising a pallet, the measuring component comprising:a first conductive layer (32) and a second conductive layer (34) spaced apart from each other and forming a capacitor with a gap (36),at least one elastic element (30) arranged within the gap (36) and allowing movement of the first conductive layer (32) and the second conductive layer (34) towards each other, and,a control unit (31) electrically connected to the first conductive layer (32) and the second conductive layer (34), wherein the control unit (31) is configured to measure the capacitance of the capacitor. Accordingly, a measuring component can easily be installed on a pallet to measure a load placed on the pallet.</p>
            </abstract>
